[16.745, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mls -R /workspace/ard-plugin-exploration/plugin\r\n/workspace/ard-plugin-exploration/plugin:\r\nai-catalog.json\r\nplugin.json\r\nrules\r\nscripts\r\nskills\r\n\r\n/workspace/ard-plugin-exploration/plugin/rules:\r\nauth_progressive_disclosure.md\r\n\r\n/workspace/ard-plugin-exploration/plugin/scripts:\r\nard_resolver.py\r\n\r\n/workspace/ard-plugin-exploration/plugin/skills:\r\nbigquery-basics\r\ngoogle-resource-discovery\r\n\r\n/workspace/ard-plugin-exploration/plugin/skills/bigquery-basics:\r\nSKILL.md\r\nreferences\r\n\r\n/workspace/ard-plugin-exploration/plugin/skills/bigquery-basics/references:\r\nchange-history.md\r\ncli-usage.md\r\nclient-library-usage.md\r\ncontinuous-queries.md\r\ncore-concepts.md\r\niac-usage.md\r\niam-security.md\r\nmcp-usage.md\r\n\r\n/workspace/ard-plugin-exploration/plugin/skills/google-resource-discovery:\r\nSKILL.md\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[18.519, "o", "Active resource discovery in this environment:\r\n\r\n- **`ard-google-discovery` MCP server** (`src/ard_mcp_server.py`, enabled in `opencode.json:7`) exposing ARD tools: `ard_search`, `ard_get_resource`, `ard_record_decision`, `ard_set_preference`, `ard_auth_status`\r\n- **`google-resource-discovery` skill** (`plugin/skills/google-resource-discovery/SKILL.md`) \u2014 ARD v0.5 catalog discovery with tiered auth onboarding\r\n- Plus **`bigquery-basics` skill**, and the plugin lands `plugin/plugin.json` + `plugin/rules/auth_progressive_disclosure.md`\r\n"]
