[39.295, "o", "For database schema design + SQL optimization, here's what's available:\r\n\r\n**Tier 0 (offline, ready now):**\r\n- **`urn:ai:google.com:skills:bigquery-guidelines`** \u2014 SQL query optimization, partitioning/clustering, window functions, analytical schema design. Also available locally as the `bigquery-basics` skill.\r\n- **`urn:ai:google.com:skills:database-design`** \u2014 relational normalization, Spanner interleaved keys, AlloyDB columnar indexing, Zero-Downtime migration planning.\r\n\r\n**Tier 3 (require GCP ADC):**\r\n- **`mcp:bigquery`** \u2014 execute queries, inspect schemas, dry-run cost estimation.\r\n- **`mcp:cloud-sql`** / **`mcp:spanner`** / **`mcp:alloydb`** \u2014 live instance management, schema changes, query execution.\r\n\r\nThe two offline skills cover both halves of your question (design + optimization) with zero auth. Want me to load one of them, or would you prefer to connect a managed MCP server via `gcloud auth application-default login`?\r\n"]
