[58.269, "o", "**BigQuery SQL & Performance Guidelines Skill** (`urn:ai:google.com:skills:bigquery-guidelines`)\r\n\r\n- **Type:** `application/ai-skill` \u2014 No-auth guidance skill (Tier 0), fully offline/free.\r\n- **Purpose:** Best practices for writing optimal BigQuery SQL \u2014 query optimization, partitioning/clustering, analytical schema design, and window functions.\r\n- **Capabilities:**\r\n  - `sql-query-optimization`\r\n  - `partitioning-and-clustering-design`\r\n  - `analytical-schema-design`\r\n  - `window-function-recipes`\r\n- **Example uses:** optimize BigQuery SQL, how to partition/cluster tables, avoid full table scans, analytical schema best practices.\r\n- **Source:** `github.com/google/skills` \u2192 `skills/cloud/bigquery-basics/SKILL.md`\r\n- **Auth:** None required (Tier 0).\r\n\r\nNote: it's a reference/guidance skill \u2014 it pairs with things like the `bigquery-basics` skill for actual query execution. Want me to pull the full SKILL.md content?\r\n"]
