[74.409, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"BigQuery SQL guidelines best practices\"}\r\n"]
[76.218, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_record_decision {\"decision\":\"allowed\",\"service_identifier\":\"urn:ai:google.com:skills:bigquery-guidelines\"}\r\n"]
[76.781, "o", "\u001b[0m% \u001b[0mWebFetch https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/skills/main/skills/cloud/bigquery-basics/SKILL.md\r\n"]
[76.921, "o", "Found it \u2014 the BigQuery guidelines skill is **Tier 0 (zero auth)**, ready to use. Let me record your consent\r\n"]
[77.046, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mls plugin/skills 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; ls plugin 2>/dev/null\r\nbigquery-basics\r\ngoogle-resource-discovery\r\n---\r\nai-catalog.json\r\nplugin.json\r\nrules\r\nscripts\r\nskills\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[79.454, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2192 \u001b[0mSkill \"bigquery-basics\"\r\nThe BigQuery guidelines skill (Tier 0, zero auth) is enabled and your consent is recorded. The local plugin already ships this skill as `bigquery-basics` \u2014 loading\r\n"]
[81.176, "o", "Done. The **BigQuery guidelines skill** (`urn:ai:google.com:skills:bigquery-guidelines`) is enabled and loaded.\r\n\r\n- **Tier 0** \u2014 zero auth, ready for offline/local use (no ADC or API key needed)\r\n- Decision recorded as `allowed`, so you won't be prompted again\r\n- Local skill `plugin/skills/bigquery-basics` is active with 8 references (core concepts, CLI, IAM/security, partitioning/clustering, etc.)\r\n\r\nIt covers SQL optimization, partitioning/clustering design, analytical schemas, and window-function recipes. What would you like to do with it?\r\n"]
